Captain Ejnar Mikkelsen, played by Nikolaj Coster-Waldau.

5
00:29:42,352 --> 00:29:48,352
Iver Iversen, played by Joe Cole.

6
00:35:38,823 --> 00:35:44,823
Minister Neergaard, played by Charles Dance.

7
00:41:35,294 --> 00:41:41,294
Naja Holm, played by Heida Reed.

8
00:47:31,764 --> 00:47:37,764
Jørgensen, played by Gísli Örn Garðarsson.

9
00:53:28,235 --> 00:53:34,235
Laub, played by Sam Redford.

10
00:59:24,705 --> 00:59:30,705
Against the Ice is a 2022 historical survival film directed by Peter Flinth and written by Nikolaj Coster-Waldau
and Joe Derrick, based on the true story recounted in Two Against the Ice by Ejnar Mikkelsen.

11
01:05:21,176 --> 01:05:27,176
It stars Coster-Waldau, Joe Cole, Charles Dance, and Heida Reed.

12
01:11:17,647 --> 01:11:23,647
The film was shot in Iceland and Greenland.

13
01:17:14,117 --> 01:17:20,117
Against the Ice premiered at the 72nd Berlin
International Film Festival on February 15, 2022.

14
01:23:10,588 --> 01:23:16,588
It was released on Netflix on March 2, 2022, and
received mixed reviews from critics.

15
01:29:07,058 --> 01:29:13,058
The film explores themes of based on novel or book, based on true
story, survival, struggle for survival, greenland.

16
